Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where you were hiding, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that's gonna be your new body.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I can remember when my soul\Nslipped away before I conked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.46,0:00:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me that you had to go, that\Nyou would make it right, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're in the game, that you'll\Nbring it all home for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It would mean the world\Nif you'd call again,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.02,0:01:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand in fear,\Nbut I'll be the same day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The hope is that the end of the\Nyear, the future will be known.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.40,0:01:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the same way,\Nand I'll be the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the same way, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, from their eyes,\Nthey'll be the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Wrecking Crew. The End.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Nessuno può scegliere il destino scelto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.24,0:02:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Roman solo il risultato\Nche voi sarete distrutti.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.72,0:02:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,L 'eterna Zoom esiste solo per me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can sing canzoni of\Nsadness on Monday without time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:03:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come. Take the arrow and\Nimpel your stand. The hell he did a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.56,0:03:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,180 he's coming in real hot trono\Nyou have to try and stop him now it's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.54,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,too far i can't you've got to be
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,kidding what are you waiting for it's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,because you've got the arrow just my luck\Nit had to crap out now The arrow! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I thought to swipe\Nthat stupid Kotz Beretta just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.16,0:03:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the hell, bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,None of you told me my\Nrevolver was in such bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.94,0:03:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it was the boss who broke it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.50,0:03:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Feet before opening that\Nbig mouth, number five!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look around, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.06,0:03:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There ain't nothing here but air!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so how could the boss even touch us? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anyone near us\Nwhen the darn thing broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's metal fatigue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.74,0:03:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been using it too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's totally normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the damn crane's giving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.74,0:04:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,All this fighting with no\Nmaintenance can't be good for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How many more times am I\Ngonna have to shoot your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's my life he's after now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.82,0:04:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply having the arrow\Nback is no longer enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.22,0:04:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Requiem now seeks to punish\Nme because I dared to touch the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A little help, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.78,0:04:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my reload?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.12,0:04:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't a revolver!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna need a new magazine!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,In my tank, it's longer than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:04:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Journal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:04:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Got something for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna throw it! Go wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.28,0:05:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks fine, but still, how did...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, take a moment to think back on\Nwhat I said to you at the Colosseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.72,0:05:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I confess to not fully grasping\Nthe extent of Requiem's powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.60,0:05:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That has now changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With his true plans in motion,\Nhe's lost interest in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.14,0:05:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean his true plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're unfurling before your very eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm beginning to mutate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.58,0:05:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Requiem gave up on chasing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is but the first\Nstage in his grand plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,His intentions weren't\Nmerely to swap our souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He seeded our transformation\Ninto completely new beings!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The prelude is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now comes the crescendo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.80,0:06:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether or not I live is irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The history of the world\Nhas unfolded on its
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.78,0:06:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,own path for four and\Na half billion years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem will thrust it on a\Nnew one in a matter of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.86,0:06:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The true nature of his\Npowers has been laid bare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Crazy, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.66,0:06:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your help has been most invaluable to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The path forward is finally clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With nothing left in my way,\Nthe arrow will soon be mine and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.12,0:06:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,it's all thanks to you what the\Nhell is happening to these people
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,his powers insane you said\Nthis is happening everywhere it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.68,0:06:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't look like it's causing\Nthem any sort of pain at least
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:07:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,they've all got blank stares\Nin their faces but even so I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.10,0:07:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,can't shake the horrible thought\Nthat my body's gonna mutate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real. Right, am\NI seriously gonna mold piece by
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.34,0:07:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,piece until there's nothing left\Nof me trish i i'm fine i think
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no stopping the process now\Nin a few short hours we will all have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,finished our damnable mutations then we\Nbetter not waste even a second let's get a
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,move on you did this you just had to\Ntouch the arrow didn't you defeat diavolo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.98,0:07:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,my big fat hairy stinking ass all the\Narrow has done is and send our life to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.90,0:07:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell he\Ncould have foreseen this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.84,0:07:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We must refocus and figure\Nout how to take down Requiem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.34,0:07:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Run to him, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.94,0:07:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Move in nice and close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel the remainder\Nof his secrets unraveling
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.06,0:07:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,faster and faster with each step you take.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me seize the power of the arrows\Nso the world may grovel at my feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We've almost got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.82,0:08:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.73,0:08:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody stand still right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.92,0:08:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay far apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.75,0:08:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't move a muscle! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to freeze, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to catch up with Requiem later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.54,0:08:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, Giorno?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to get us killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't\Nnoticed, my body's melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a closer look at your revolver.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The one you said just broke,\Nsomething's off about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The broken piece doesn't fit quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.78,0:08:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That shouldn't be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If it really were Metal Fatigue,\Nthe pieces would fit perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, what exactly are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to stay in place too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem's getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If the bullets say it's cause\Nthe stupid gun gave out,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.84,0:08:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,then that's what frickin' happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,End of story!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.20,0:08:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it got me the sweet Beretta now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The two pieces don't fit right,\Ncause a chunk probably fell off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.52,0:08:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's far more likely\Nto be something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll know for sure as soon\Nas we get that lost piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look, Golden Wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave part of the gun\Nlife and let it run loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's blind, but its\Nnose makes up for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.28,0:09:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It can pick up things our eyes might miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.20,0:09:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Little guy just proved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.98,0:09:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's found a critical\Npiece of this puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, come on! Forget them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you, it's impossible\Nfor another person to have done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullets and I aren't stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We know what we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.22,0:09:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody got anywhere close to me\Nwhen the damn revolver broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.24,0:09:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we're standing apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, his range is just a few meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No one got anywhere close to\NNarancia when he was killed either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.84,0:09:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No one besides any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Polnareff,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if it really is as you say And the boss\Ndoes turn out to possess two personas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.60,0:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That means his soul could\Nreside in anybody he chooses!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My guess: Diavolo is hiding\Nout inside one of us? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think about it Why hasn't Trish\Nbeen able to sense him this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's not the only thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's also waiting for us to\Ndie doing his dirty work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.58,0:10:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the reason why your gun broke
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are, Mista!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.90,0:10:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to remain out of his range!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one whose gun\Nwas destroyed, moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And the person closest to it was you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.42,0:10:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Right before Narancia\Ngot killed, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The closest one was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to act quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem is about to slip from my grasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:11:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Churno Chuvana, you pestilent brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's inside one of us,\Nthat's all I know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What might not be obvious is we've\Ngot him backed into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Diavolo might be able to\Nsic Emperor Crimson on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but he still can't completely\Ncontrol his physical host.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.74,0:11:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he did have that kind of freedom, there'd\Nbe no need for him to use subterfuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd just finish us all off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exactly because he's so constrained\Nthat we're all still standing here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We have the upper hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not waste this chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What if it's the turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the only one around\Nme when my revolver broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.04,0:11:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's gotta be Polnareff\Nwho got possessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you've forgotten, Requiem\Nalmost killed him just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and only because the\Nboss broke your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss wouldn't risk letting\Ninjury befall his physical host.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.32,0:11:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can only\Nsense one soul in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:11:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a singular turtle\Nwith only one spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can discern souls? That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't make direct\Nphysical contact, then no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Life energy comes in clusters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct touch tells me how\Nmany souls in a clump.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.68,0:12:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to touch each\Nof you briefly to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.68,0:12:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There still remains one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:25.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you fall within the boss's range?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a trick for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.39,0:12:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff kindly taught it to me earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to look for a\Nsudden increase in blood drops.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll tell me if time has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That might help you detect him.\NBut the rest will all be on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,fates be willing you might just be\Nable to narrowly dodge his strike
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's definitely not\Nme. How I mean, there's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.76,0:12:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,no way I was the furthest\Nperson from Narancia
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't I just examine\Nyou first and get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,over with what you You\Ncan stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.76,0:13:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Diavolo's hiding in you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what happens?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.14,0:13:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,By the time Narancia died,\Nhis body was an empty shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I know because my soul could travel\Nseamlessly into it, nothing stopped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm sure it's just me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.64,0:13:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, gee, that's a super\Nreassuring story. Is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,what i'd say if i had\Nany way of confirming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true. I mean, come\Non, how could you know for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,sure the boss isn't actually\Nhiding somewhere in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.32,0:13:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There it doesn't look like you can check\Nyourself with that ability can you vista if
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you keep this Up we can\Nkiss the arrow goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,stop or you'll kiss your kneecaps goodbye?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can check me first, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.98,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We've wasted too much time on bickering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.24,0:14:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We should seize the chance to hit\Nthe boss while he's vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other way. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We must proceed quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's dying. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.52,0:14:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If we move closer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.38,0:15:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Turtle it was Mista. The boss was\Nhiding inside him. Spicy lady first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he wasn't you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But horrifying speed he was able to close\Nthe distance in nearly no time at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this moment.\NYour stand finally appears before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My Trish, had you not foolishly\Nrevealed your stand to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,your dear friends may very well\Nhave succeeded in their gambit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Release her at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as your stand is in my grasp,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear you're little more than a\Npuppet enslaved to my every whim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going for a strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.42,0:15:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is about to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he forget to murder us first?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.02,0:15:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.48,0:16:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's likely we're not at the\Ntop of his list right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,His focus seems to be\Non seizing the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the only real thing that\Nmatters, and he knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him, Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't be allowed to reach it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.58,0:16:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull the damn trigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.90,0:16:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A few bullet wounds are nothing\Ncompared to what he will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the problem is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already shot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I counted fired all six shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastards messing with time as he's\Nrunning if he sees him coming my bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,After him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.98,0:16:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over if he gets that arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.10,0:16:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That shadow, it must hold the key\Nto the arrow's imperviousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if my theory\Nproves to be correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem's shadow always\Nextends in the direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Opposing my movements, regardless\Nof the sun's actual position.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That must mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To that man's eyes, the shadow should\Nappear as if it is stretching toward me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But to Bucciarati, the shadow is\Nextending in front of Requiem itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.14,0:17:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, the position of the shadow\Ndepends on the position of the observer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Cretanous Jade, your\Npowers are no mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand how you manipulate souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.26,0:17:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Requiem is the silhouette of the soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.36,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,To face it is to contend with\Nthe shadow of one's own mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, attacking it is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's akin to attacking oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.94,0:17:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I eliminate this shadow,\Nthe arrow will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.00,0:17:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then, wherever a shadow treads,\Na source of light must also be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.20,0:17:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He still hasn't gotten the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for Brokemista!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The only place it could\Nbe is behind my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He struck something behind his\Nhead, yet Requiem suffered the blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.38,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.26,0:18:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold, the final victor\Nis I! I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Diavolo somehow gets his vile\Nhands on the arrow, the fight goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just improvise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.18,0:18:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky for me, the blood he spilled when\Nhe severed my arm is just ordinary matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No different from anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now ain't that right, Golden Wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.52,0:18:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening? That damn mongrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.34,0:18:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Not too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta catch up with them quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire again, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.98,0:18:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:18:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.01,0:19:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you didn't predict\Nthat, you freakin' idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.60,0:19:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Deflect the bullets comin'\Nat you all you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do jack shit\Nabout these other guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fellas!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.62,0:19:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Y 'all flick that baby back to Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He just launched a whole person!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.48,0:19:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All the way toward the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So he did predict our trajectory!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He used the body to course correct!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you truly believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.80,0:19:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,even for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,that your laughably slow wits could ever\Nhope to overcome my predictive mastery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no flaws to exploit, as\NI'm sure you've recently learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.46,0:19:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Bucciarati, you and your\Ngaggle did manage to make me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you would be foolish\Nenough to betray your own Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.10,0:19:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,nor did I believe you competent\Nenough to discover my true identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I'm grateful this path has led\Nme to the true power of the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.42,0:19:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Fate never fails!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:20:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A fitting reward for ones who have\Nconquered the adversity of their past!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, Reload, don't just stare!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We already told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That magazine takes us a\Nlittle bit longer to refill!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.20,0:20:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.11,0:20:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.06,0:20:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Spicy lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.60,0:20:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't deflect squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullets bounced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned them to chewing gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They stretched out thin as they flew, but\Nthey clung to your fists the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they sprung back to me and threw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.64,0:20:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, how long were you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I too will conquer my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.98,0:20:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to be afraid, to\Nlive in fear of my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.52,0:20:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't run from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If it gets in my way, then I'll climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.74,0:20:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow! You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.66,0:21:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so damn close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, I almost got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.82,0:21:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiss my ass, Diablo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and warp time or predict stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.92,0:21:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The arrow's coming to me, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.82,0:21:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear girl, how I wish I had never\Nbrought you into this wretched world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems I've yet to break free of my past.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.12,0:21:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse it, worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.78,0:21:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.70,0:21:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it you said about fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You just climb, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope you like flying instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.42,0:21:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.38,0:22:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see this alive. We are the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.68,0:22:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Power. Who's in the future? Cause
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the fighters. Just\Nfighting for the rise. Let's fight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.56,0:22:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.34,0:23:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
